{
    "title": "Minichat \u2013 The Fast Video Chat",
    "description": "<h1><b><font color=\"#4a75a6\">Minichat is a free cam chat app that instantly connects you with thousands of people online.</font></b></h1>It's time to get excited! If you\u2019re looking for a simple video chat app to meet new people around the world, Minichat is for you! In Minichat, nothing is impossible \u2014 finding new friends, getting a date, or even falling in love with someone you just met. With this cam chat, thousands of live video streams are at your fingertips. The Minichat video app is designed with simplicity in mind. Anyone willing to get acquainted and communicate can install it for free and use without limits.\r\n\r\n<h2><b><font color=\"#4a75a6\">Here is what Minichat can offer you, as a video chat service:</font></b></h2><b>SOCIAL</b>\r\nMinichat is a social platform for like-minded people. Everyone here is looking for the same thing \u2014 live dialogues in the cam chat. It doesn't matter who you are and where you are from. In the video chat, you will always find someone to talk to.\r\n\r\n<b>FUN</b>\r\nYou can talk about anything you like. Tell jokes, show tricks, flirt with each other, share stories, read poems, sing \u2026 or just listen to what your chatting partner wants to share with you. You will not believe how many things two people can do together in the cam chat!\r\n\r\n<b>ANONYMOUS</b>\r\nYou appear to others as a complete stranger, unless you meet someone you like, and you both really want to get to know each other. So, break the ice and don't be shy! If you feel the conversation isn't going anywhere \u2014 there are no strings attached. You can say \u201cbye\u201d just as easy as you said \u201chi,\u201d and no one will ever judge you.\r\n\r\n<b>FREE</b>\r\nPaid features, ads, or subscriptions in Minichat? Never! No bells and whistles and no pay-to-play \u2014 just thousands of people waiting for you to join. There are no time limits on the conversations either \u2014 take your time and talk as long as you want. It's a premium video chat, free by default.\r\n\r\n<b>SAFE</b>\r\nMinichat is a community of friendly and kind people. Thanks to a proactive moderation and reporting system, you can feel safe. Any inappropriate behavior, harassment, and intimidation will lead to banishment. Please read the rules of the video chat to stay on the safe side at https://minichat.com/rules.\r\n\r\n<b>& MORE</b>\r\nBesides the many exciting things you can do in the video chat \u2014 making new friends, flirting, dating, and having fun \u2014 there is an excellent opportunity to enhance your foreign language skills with native speakers from many countries. Just choose your preferred country where you would like your chat companion to be from and start chatting. Moreover, with the instant translation of text messages, you will overcome language barriers. Write comfortably in your native language, hit send, and see the magic happening. Minichat will convey your message to your cam chat buddy in one of the many available languages!\r\n\r\n<h2><b><font color=\"#4a75a6\">How to use Minichat:</font></b></h2>This app is easy to use. Sign in, pick a country, tap the blue button, and meet your first random chat partner.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd35 Use the blue button to start the video chat or to switch to the next person;\r\n\ud83d\udd34 Use the red button to stop and disconnect.\r\n\r\nThe video chat is available any time of day or night. You can join it in a snap \u2014 alone, with a friend, or even with a bunch of people, hanging out and looking for entertainment. Whenever you feel like chatting with someone from the wild, online crowd of cool people \u2014 give Minichat a try!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h1><b><font color=\"#4a75a6\">Minichat is a free cam chat app that instantly connects you with thousands of people online.</font></b></h1>It&#39;s time to get excited! If you\u2019re looking for a simple video chat app to meet new people around the world, Minichat is for you! In Minichat, nothing is impossible \u2014 finding new friends, getting a date, or even falling in love with someone you just met. With this cam chat, thousands of live video streams are at your fingertips. The Minichat video app is designed with simplicity in mind. Anyone willing to get acquainted and communicate can install it for free and use without limits.<br><br><h2><b><font color=\"#4a75a6\">Here is what Minichat can offer you, as a video chat service:</font></b></h2><b>SOCIAL</b><br>Minichat is a social platform for like-minded people. Everyone here is looking for the same thing \u2014 live dialogues in the cam chat. It doesn&#39;t matter who you are and where you are from. In the video chat, you will always find someone to talk to.<br><br><b>FUN</b><br>You can talk about anything you like. Tell jokes, show tricks, flirt with each other, share stories, read poems, sing \u2026 or just listen to what your chatting partner wants to share with you. You will not believe how many things two people can do together in the cam chat!<br><br><b>ANONYMOUS</b><br>You appear to others as a complete stranger, unless you meet someone you like, and you both really want to get to know each other. So, break the ice and don&#39;t be shy! If you feel the conversation isn&#39;t going anywhere \u2014 there are no strings attached. You can say \u201cbye\u201d just as easy as you said \u201chi,\u201d and no one will ever judge you.<br><br><b>FREE</b><br>Paid features, ads, or subscriptions in Minichat? Never! No bells and whistles and no pay-to-play \u2014 just thousands of people waiting for you to join. There are no time limits on the conversations either \u2014 take your time and talk as long as you want. It&#39;s a premium video chat, free by default.<br><br><b>SAFE</b><br>Minichat is a community of friendly and kind people. Thanks to a proactive moderation and reporting system, you can feel safe. Any inappropriate behavior, harassment, and intimidation will lead to banishment. Please read the rules of the video chat to stay on the safe side at https://minichat.com/rules.<br><br><b>&amp; MORE</b><br>Besides the many exciting things you can do in the video chat \u2014 making new friends, flirting, dating, and having fun \u2014 there is an excellent opportunity to enhance your foreign language skills with native speakers from many countries. Just choose your preferred country where you would like your chat companion to be from and start chatting. Moreover, with the instant translation of text messages, you will overcome language barriers. Write comfortably in your native language, hit send, and see the magic happening. Minichat will convey your message to your cam chat buddy in one of the many available languages!<br><br><h2><b><font color=\"#4a75a6\">How to use Minichat:</font></b></h2>This app is easy to use. Sign in, pick a country, tap the blue button, and meet your first random chat partner.<br><br>\ud83d\udd35 Use the blue button to start the video chat or to switch to the next person;<br>\ud83d\udd34 Use the red button to stop and disconnect.<br><br>The video chat is available any time of day or night. You can join it in a snap \u2014 alone, with a friend, or even with a bunch of people, hanging out and looking for entertainment. Whenever you feel like chatting with someone from the wild, online crowd of cool people \u2014 give Minichat a try!",
